     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Please forward widely.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">--</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi all,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\">The first meeting of the Davis R-Users&#39; Group will be tomorrow, Thursday September 22, 1-3pm in Wickson 2124. If you haven&#39;t been to our meetings before, they are a place to code, ask and answer questions, and discuss all things R. No expertise necessary -- we keep it friendly and helpful for newcomers and experts alike. It&#39;s a great place to ask those embarrassing questions (we all have them), get unstuck when you run into problems, or have someone review your code. Every few weeks we have a talk on a particular R tool, and we&#39;re going to try a couple fun (hopefully) new things for meetings later this quarter. If you&#39;d like to stay tuned, join our <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467196460000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FKHt2KEeCuxA_ue_d_Zx0\">mailing list</a>, which is another great to place to ask questions, and checkout our <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467196460000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yyI71AeQGaPbA5_5ivDqw\">website</a>. See you tomorrow,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br>Michael</div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><br></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"line-height:normal\">Michael Levy</font></p><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">PhD Candidate</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Department of Environmental Science and Policy</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">University of California, Davis</span><br></div><div><a href style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a><br></div><div><font color=\"#0000ee\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><u><a href=\"http://www.michaellevy.name/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.michaellevy.name/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467196460000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mjHY45rbFJsFnewOWSnNA\">www.michaellevy.name</a></u></font></div><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
